      "summary": "Emma Bonino, a prominent Italian politician, feminist and human-rights activist who served as a European Commissioner and as Italy’s foreign minister, has died at the age of 78. Widely recognised for her campaigns on civil liberties, women's rights and social reform, she received international honours during a long public career that drew both domestic and international attention."
